    <bpmn:process id="W_W683" name="W683. Employee Competency Assessment &amp; Certification Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual competency assessment cycle; role-change events; regulatory certification requirements
Frequency: Annual formal assessment; semi-annual recertification for safety-critical roles; ad-hoc for role changes
Volume: 6,911 employees across 5 entities; ~200 unique competency profiles across roles
Owner: HR Training Manager
Participants: Department Supervisor/Manager, HR Business Partner, Employee, External Certification Body
Source: workflow W683 — Employee Competency Assessment &amp; Certification Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W683_LaneSet7">
        <bpmn:lane id="W683_Lane1" name="HR Training Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W683_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W683_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W683_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W683_Task16</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W683_Start8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W683_Lane2" name="Employee">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W683_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W683_Lane3" name="Department Supervisor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W683_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W683_Lane4" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W683_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W683_Lane5" name="HR Business Partner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W683_Task15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W683_Lane6" name="HR Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W683_Task17</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W683_End18</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W683_Start8" name="Annual competency assessment cycle; role-change events; regulatory certification…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W683_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W683_Task9" name="HR Training Manager maintains competency framework per role: store associate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: HR Training Manager maintains competency framework per role: store associate (product knowledge per department, POS operations, customer service, safety), store supervisor (leadership, inventory management, merchandising, scheduling), DC staff (forklift, RF scanning, safety, hazmat), corporate staff (role-specific technical competencies)
Responsible (R): HR Training Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W683_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W683_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W683_Task10" name="Annual: system generates competency assessment schedules for all employees…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Annual: system generates competency assessment schedules for all employees based on role and last assessment date; Department Supervisor receives assessment forms per direct report
Responsible (R): HR Training Manager
Accountable (A): Department Supervisor
Duration: 1 hour setup</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W683_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W683_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W683_Task11" name="Employee completes self-assessment against competency profile: rates each…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Employee completes self-assessment against competency profile: rates each competency 1-5 (1=Awareness, 2=Basic, 3=Intermediate, 4=Advanced, 5=Expert) with supporting evidence
Responsible (R): Employee
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W683_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W683_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W683_Task12" name="Department Supervisor conducts assessment: reviews self-assessment, validates…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Department Supervisor conducts assessment: reviews self-assessment, validates through observation and practical demonstration for technical skills, interviews employee on behavioral competencies, assigns final rating
Responsible (R): Department Supervisor
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W683_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W683_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W683_Task13" name="System auto-generates competency gap analysis: identifies competencies below…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: System auto-generates competency gap analysis: identifies competencies below role minimum level (target level by competency); produces individual development plan (IDP) template with recommended training interventions per W51
Responsible (R): System (automated)
Accountable (A): HR Training Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W683_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W683_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W683_Task14" name="For safety-critical roles requiring regulatory certification (forklift…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: For safety-critical roles requiring regulatory certification (forklift operator, electrical worker, hazmat handler per W655): HR Training Manager tracks certification expiry dates; schedules recertification before expiry; system restricts work assignments for expired certifications
Responsible (R): HR Training Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 hours/month ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W683_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W683_Flow27</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W683_Task15" name="For trade-specific certifications (PCAB for construction project sales per…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: For trade-specific certifications (PCAB for construction project sales per W162, PRC license for engineers per W600): HR Business Partner verifies active license status; tracks continuing professional development (CPD) units
Responsible (R): HR Business Partner
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 hours/month ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W683_Flow27</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W683_Flow28</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W683_Task16" name="Quarterly: HR Training Manager produces competency dashboard for HR Manager…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Quarterly: HR Training Manager produces competency dashboard for HR Manager: assessment completion rate, average competency scores by role/location, gap distribution, certification compliance rate (target ≥ 95% per W655)
Responsible (R): HR Training Manager
Accountable (A): HR Manager
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W683_Flow28</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W683_Flow29</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W683_Task17" name="Annual: HR Manager reviews competency framework effectiveness with Department…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 9: Annual: HR Manager reviews competency framework effectiveness with Department Heads; updates competency profiles based on evolving role requirements (e.g., digital skills, new product categories); calibrates assessment standards across 200 stores and 4 DCs
Responsible (R): HR Manager
Accountable (A): Department Heads
Duration: 3 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W683_Flow29</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W683_Flow30</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W683_End18" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W683_Flow30</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W683_Annotation19">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-299 (ensure controlled execution — Learning &amp; Development (PA-19.4).) | - operational: HR Training Manager review and approval gate
Owner: HR Training Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
