    <bpmn:process id="W_W5525" name="W5525. Learning Platform (LMS) Administration, Integration &amp; Learning-Records Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: OLA outage, integration failure or completion-data discrepancy (W48 ticket); new-hire enrollment event from W15/W152; annual OLA currency &amp; security review (RUP/CPU intake); or the quarterly learning-records integrity audit
Frequency: Continuous platform monitoring; per-enrollment event; quarterly records audit; annual currency review
Volume: ~6,911 employees enrolled across ~180 active courses; ~1,200–1,600 new hires/year auto-enrolled; ~40 integration/exception events/month; 200 stores + 4 DCs + HQ
Owner: HR Technology Manager
Participants: LMS Administrator, Training Manager, HR Training Manager, IT Application Manager (integration &amp; SSO), HR Manager, Data Protection Officer
Source: workflow W5525 — Learning Platform (LMS) Administration, Integration &amp; Learning-Records Operations</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5525_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5525_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5525_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5525_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5525_Lane2" name="LMS Administrator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5525_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5525_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5525_Lane3" name="IT Application Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5525_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5525_Lane4" name="HR Technology Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5525_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5525_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5525_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5525_Start6" name="OLA outage, integration failure or completion-data discrepancy (W48 ticket); new-hire…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5525_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W5525_Task7" name="Platform monitoring &amp; incident triage">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Platform monitoring &amp; incident triage: OLA availability, SSO login failures and course-playback errors watched daily; anomalies auto-ticket to W48 with platform telemetry; outage communications to Training Manager and store L&amp;D coordinators
Responsible (R): System / LMS Administrator
Accountable (A): HR Technology Manager
Duration: 15 min/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5525_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5525_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5525_Task8" name="Enrollment &amp; provisioning operations">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Enrollment &amp; provisioning operations: HRIS-triggered enrollment from W15 onboarding and role changes via the W3351 worker sync; manual handling of edge cases (cross-entity transfers per W511, contingent workers per VS-98, seafarer/regional connectivity gaps)
Responsible (R): LMS Administrator
Accountable (A): HR Technology Manager
Duration: 10 min/exception × ~40/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5525_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5525_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5525_Task9" name="Integration &amp; data-flow operations">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Integration &amp; data-flow operations: completion/grade feeds back to the HRIS and BI layer (W72 performance inputs, W3347 attrition analytics, W51 compliance dashboards, W3349 scorecards); SSO via the W393 identity stack; interface health checks and replay of failed files
Responsible (R): IT Application Manager / LMS Administrator
Accountable (A): HR Technology Manager
Duration: 2 hours/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5525_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5525_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5525_Task10" name="Learning-records integrity &amp; custody">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Learning-records integrity &amp; custody: quarterly reconciliation of completion records against the HRIS headcount (~6,911); certification-expiry register feeding W683/W1127; retention and RA 10173 access controls per the W256 schedule; DOLE inspection evidence pack for OSH-critical courses
Responsible (R): LMS Administrator / HR Technology Manager
Accountable (A): HR Manager
Duration: 4 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5525_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5525_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5525_Task11" name="Configuration &amp; release management">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Configuration &amp; release management: course-catalog configuration changes and OLA patch/RUP upgrades ride W1409 CAB approval; user-acceptance testing with the Training Manager; sandbox refresh; release notes to the L&amp;D community
Responsible (R): HR Technology Manager / Training Manager
Accountable (A): HR Technology Manager
Duration: 6 hours/release × ~6/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5525_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5525_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5525_Task12" name="In-suite currency &amp; security review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: In-suite currency &amp; security review: annual OLA currency review (RUP/CPU calendar intake; Oracle Critical Patch Updates into the W1409 release calendar; license/seat posture under the enterprise EBS estate — Oracle security-alert documentation filed to the W4730 evidence repository); coordination with W3782 for the candidate/pre-boarding learning slice
Responsible (R): HR Technology Manager
Accountable (A): HR Head
Duration: 8 hours/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5525_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5525_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5525_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5525_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5525_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-299 (ensure controlled execution — Learning &amp; Development (PA-19.4).) | - operational: OLA configuration and upgrade changes ride W1409 CAB approval | - operational: quarterly learning-records reconciliation signed off by the HR Manager
Owner: HR Technology Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5525_Assoc15" sourceRef="W5525_Annotation14" targetRef="W5525_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
