    <bpmn:process id="W_W5526" name="W5526. Learning-Content Development, Course-Catalog &amp; Certification-Program Lifecycle" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New course request from a training-needs input (W51 step 6, W72 performance finding, W3345 capability gap, or new-system rollout via W1409); the quarterly course-catalog review; an SOP change from W186/W1459 invalidating course content; or content-vendor contract renewal
Frequency: Per course request; quarterly catalog review; per SOP-change trigger; annual vendor review
Volume: ~180 active courses; ~35 new/revised courses/year; ~200 SOP-governed process courses kept version-aligned; 3 external content vendors
Owner: HR Training Manager
Participants: Training Manager, Training Officer, Subject-matter experts (Category Managers, Safety Officer, IT trainers), LMS Administrator, external content vendors, HR Head
Source: workflow W5526 — Learning-Content Development, Course-Catalog &amp; Certification-Program Lifecycle</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5526_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5526_Lane1" name="HR Training Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5526_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5526_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5526_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5526_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5526_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5526_Lane2" name="Training Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5526_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5526_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5526_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5526_Start4" name="New course request from a training-needs input (W51 step 6, W72 performance finding…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5526_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5526_Task5" name="Intake &amp; instructional design">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Intake &amp; instructional design: course requests scoped into a design brief (audience, objectives, assessment method, duration, delivery mode — e-learning, facilitated, or on-the-job); priority ranked against the W51 training calendar and W1484 curriculum paths
Responsible (R): HR Training Manager
Accountable (A): HR Head
Duration: 2 hours/course × ~35/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5526_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5526_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5526_Task6" name="Content production">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Content production: SME interviews, storyboards and build in the OLA authoring tool or vendor commission; product-knowledge modules co-created with Category Managers (aligned to W1 assortment updates); safety modules co-created with the Safety Officer
Responsible (R): Training Officer / SME
Accountable (A): HR Training Manager
Duration: 12–20 hours/course (midpoint 16) × ~35/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5526_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5526_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5526_Task7" name="Catalog &amp; version governance">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Catalog &amp; version governance: quarterly catalog review retiring/superseding courses and re-mapping role curricula (W1484 paths, W567 skill matrix, W1127 re-certification); SOP-linked courses version-locked to their controlling W186 procedure so an SOP change blocks effectivity until the course is updated
Responsible (R): HR Training Manager / LMS Administrator
Accountable (A): HR Head
Duration: 4 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5526_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5526_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5526_Task8" name="Localization &amp; accessibility">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Localization &amp; accessibility: Tagalog/Cebuano facilitator guides for store-facing courses; low-bandwidth mobile variants for provincial stores; captions and scripts per the W5500 digital-accessibility standard
Responsible (R): Training Officer
Accountable (A): HR Training Manager
Duration: 2 hours/course × ~35/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5526_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5526_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5526_Task9" name="Assessment &amp; certification standard">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Assessment &amp; certification standard: quiz banks, pass marks and practical checklists aligned to the W683 competency assessments; regulatory courses carry mandatory pass/fail (forklift, fire safety, hazmat handling per the OSH Standards)
Responsible (R): HR Training Manager / Safety Officer
Accountable (A): HR Head
Duration: 2 hours/course × ~35/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5526_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5526_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5526_Task10" name="Vendor &amp; license management">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Vendor &amp; license management: external content licenses tracked (seat bands, renewal dates, usage analytics); renewal/replacement decisions feed the annual W51 calendar and budget
Responsible (R): HR Training Manager
Accountable (A): HR Head
Duration: 6 hours/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5526_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5526_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5526_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5526_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5526_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-299 (ensure controlled execution — Learning &amp; Development (PA-19.4).) | - operational: no course goes live without an approved design brief and assessment standard | - operational: SOP-linked courses carry a version-lock to the controlling procedure
Owner: HR Training Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5526_Assoc13" sourceRef="W5526_Annotation12" targetRef="W5526_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
